    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_LeaveGroupAndJoinOther",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi!\n",
        "How’s it going?\r",
        "You’re in the {STRVAR_1 61, 1, 0} group with\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} as leader, right?\r",
        "Would you like to leave that group\n",
        "and join another one?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut!\n",
        "Comment vas-tu?\r",
        "Tu es dans le groupe {STRVAR_1 61, 1, 0} avec\n",
        "à sa tête {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, non?\r",
        "Veux-tu quitter ce groupe pour en\n",
        "joindre un autre?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_LeaveGroupAndMakeNewOne",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi!\n",
