    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_WantToJoinAGroup",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, I know it’s a little sudden, but\n",
        "would you like to join a group?\r",
        "If you join a group, you can compete\n",
        "or cooperate with fellow members.\r",
        "It’s a lot of fun.\n",
        "Want to join?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut, je sais que c’est soudain mais\n",
        "veux-tu faire partie d’un groupe?\r",
        "Si tu es dans un groupe, tu peux\n",
        "affronter ses membres ou coopérer\f",
        "avec eux.\r",
        "C’est très amusant.\n",
        "Tu veux essayer?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_JoinWhichGroup",
      "en_US": "Which group would you like to join?",
      "fr_FR": "A quel groupe veux-tu te joindre?"
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_ThatsTooBad",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh.\n",
        "That’s too bad."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh...\n",
        "Quel dommage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_GroupWillBeDisbanded",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you want to make a new group?\n",
        "Sure thing!\r",
        "The group you made before will be\n",
        "disbanded, though. Is that OK?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, tu veux créer un nouveau groupe?\n",
        "Pas de problème!\r",
        "Mais le groupe que tu as créé avant\n",
        "sera dissous. Tu es d’accord?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_NameYourGroup",
      "en_US": [
        "Yay, cool! What do you want to name\n",
        "your group?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ouais, cool! Comment veux-tu appeler\n",
        "ton groupe?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_ThatsAGreatName",
      "en_US": [
        "The {STRVAR_1 61, 0, 0} group, huh?\n",
        "That’s a great name!\r",
        "The leader is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "I hope the group gets more members."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le groupe {STRVAR_1 61, 0, 0}, hein?\n",
        "C’est un super nom!\r",
        "A sa tête, il y a {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "J’espère que le groupe aura de\n",
        "nouveaux membres."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_JoinThisGroup",
      "en_US": [
        "The {STRVAR_1 61, 0, 0} group?\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} is the leader.\f",
        "Would you like to join this group?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le groupe {STRVAR_1 61, 0, 0}?\n",
        "Avec à sa tête {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}...\f",
        "Veux-tu te joindre à ce groupe?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_NowAMemberOfGroup",
      "en_US": [
        "OK! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is now a member\n",
        "of the {STRVAR_1 61, 1, 0} group."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "OK! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} est maintenant membre\n",
        "du groupe {STRVAR_1 61, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GroupConnection_Text_GroupInfo",
      "en_US": [
        "When you form or join a new group,\n",
        "be sure to visit any Union Room.\r",
        "Mix your records with group members,\n",
        "and you’ll become integrated.\r",
        "When you’re in the same group,\n",
        "events can happen simultaneously.\r",
        "It makes things a lot more fun\n",
        "playing in a group!\r",
        "Anyone can make a group, and anyone\n",
        "can join.\r",
        "I hope you recruit lots of friends\n",
        "so everyone can have fun!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quand tu formes un nouveau groupe ou\n",
        "joins un nouveau groupe, va à la Salle\f",
        "Union.\r",
        "Fais un échange de données avec les\n",
        "membres pour t’intégrer.\r",
        "Quand on est dans un même groupe, des\n",
        "événements peuvent avoir lieu en même\f",
        "temps pour tous.\r",
        "Les choses sont bien plus amusantes\n",
        "quand on joue en groupe!\r",
        "Tout le monde peut créer un groupe ou\n",
        "se joindre à un groupe.\r",
        "J’espère que tu recruteras plein\n",
        "d’amis pour bien vous amuser ensemble!"
      ]
    },
